{
    "title": "Hubzu - Real Estate Auctions",
    "description": "Buying real estate auction properties just got easier. Search and bid on properties, find detailed property information, receive auction alerts and easily place bids on properties on our free app. As one of the largest online home auction marketing platforms, Hubzu has helped real estate agents, home buyers and investors buy and sell thousands of properties across all 50 states. Get the Hubzu app to find your next investment property.\r\n\r\n<b>The Hubzu App</b>\r\n\r\nHubzu\u2019s new and improved mobile app has what you need to stay in the loop and boost your real estate portfolio on-the-go. Find properties around the country, receive real-time auction alerts and effortlessly place bids on your favorite homes.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n\r\n\u25cf Quickly view property details, photos, street-view mapping, rental estimates, school information, property tax and price history, auction dates, bid prices and more\r\n\r\n\u25cf Be the first to see new properties and promotions on Hubzu\r\n\r\n\u25cf Save your favorite properties and bid directly from your smartphone\r\n\r\n\u25cf Receive real-time alerts when you\u2019ve been outbid or an auction is ending soon\r\n\r\n\u25cf Get updates about upcoming auctions and the latest available properties\r\n\r\nTransparent, accessible and convenient, Hubzu is the go-to marketing platform for investment properties. From foreclosures and short sales to REO and luxury properties, you\u2019ll find thousands of opportunities on Hubzu.\r\n\r\nUsing our interactive app, you can quickly view property details, photos, auction dates, bid prices and more. Our smart technology, educational resources and wide selection of properties are just a few of the perks accessible to you on-the-go, wherever you are.\r\n\r\nSave and favorite properties you like and receive instant notifications, so you\u2019ll never lose track of your investments. Join us on the Hubzu app now for a better way to bid.\r\n\r\nDon't miss out on your next investment opportunity. With the Hubzu app, it's all at your fingertips.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Buying real estate auction properties just got easier. Search and bid on properties, find detailed property information, receive auction alerts and easily place bids on properties on our free app. As one of the largest online home auction marketing platforms, Hubzu has helped real estate agents, home buyers and investors buy and sell thousands of properties across all 50 states. Get the Hubzu app to find your next investment property.<br><br><b>The Hubzu App</b><br><br>Hubzu\u2019s new and improved mobile app has what you need to stay in the loop and boost your real estate portfolio on-the-go. Find properties around the country, receive real-time auction alerts and effortlessly place bids on your favorite homes.<br><br>Key features:<br><br>\u25cf Quickly view property details, photos, street-view mapping, rental estimates, school information, property tax and price history, auction dates, bid prices and more<br><br>\u25cf Be the first to see new properties and promotions on Hubzu<br><br>\u25cf Save your favorite properties and bid directly from your smartphone<br><br>\u25cf Receive real-time alerts when you\u2019ve been outbid or an auction is ending soon<br><br>\u25cf Get updates about upcoming auctions and the latest available properties<br><br>Transparent, accessible and convenient, Hubzu is the go-to marketing platform for investment properties. From foreclosures and short sales to REO and luxury properties, you\u2019ll find thousands of opportunities on Hubzu.<br><br>Using our interactive app, you can quickly view property details, photos, auction dates, bid prices and more. Our smart technology, educational resources and wide selection of properties are just a few of the perks accessible to you on-the-go, wherever you are.<br><br>Save and favorite properties you like and receive instant notifications, so you\u2019ll never lose track of your investments. Join us on the Hubzu app now for a better way to bid.<br><br>Don&#39;t miss out on your next investment opportunity. With the Hubzu app, it&#39;s all at your fingertips.",
